      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T18:39:48Z",
      "body": "Looked into this on current main, the original AttributeError is gone after the Argument refactor, but the underlying problem is still there, `addoption(\"shuffle\")` gets silently registered as a required positional, so every run then dies with `the following arguments are required: shuffle`.\n\nI'll put up a PR rejecting non-dash option strings in `_addoption_inner` with a clear error, plus a regression test.",
